etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">李飞飞团队发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，揭示大模型空间交互短板</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动联合港科大发布MMProLong模型，优化长文档LMM训练效率</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波LingBot-VA论文被机器人顶会RSS2026接收，实现边推演边行动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dabf9667e4b53edfd4551849456dda7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁灵波科技与香港科技大学合作的论文《Causal World Modeling for Robot Control》被机器人顶级会议RSS 2026接收，并开源了全球首个自回归视频-动作世界模型LingBot-VA。该模型采用Mixture-of-Transformers架构，将视频预测与动作生成统一至自回归扩散框架，使机器人具备“边观察、边判断、边行动”的因果推演能力。在技术实现上，LingBot-VA通过闭环推演机制减少误差累积，支持长时序任务。性能方面，在RoboTwin 2.0基准测试中，其Easy与Hard任务成功率分别达92.0%和91.1%；在真实世界评测中，仅需50条示范数据即可完成适配，成功率较业界基线π0.5提升超20个百分点。目前，该模型权重及代码已在Hugging Face与GitHu</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯ima宣布全面开放Copilot并上线知识技能分享平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/83c98052c772028ca96b711420209181.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能知识管理平台ima今日宣布，其AI智能体产品“Copilot”正式取消排队机制，实现全面开放。ima Copilot定位为“知识Agent”，具备持续进化的记忆与全场景感知能力，支持用户调用个人知识库、接入外部模型API及扩展自定义Skill。官方演示显示，该Agent可通过自然语言指令自动执行网页浏览、全网调研、数据分析及可视化报告生成等复杂任务。同期，ima推出知识技能分享平台，用户可将工作流程封装为Skill并发布至“知识广场”的Skills专区，实现知识能力的沉淀与流转。首批已上线“微信读书”、“腾讯招聘”等官方Skill。此次更新标志着ima从单一知识管理工具向集“知识沉淀、智能调用、能力共享”于一体的“知识+Agent”平台转型。用户更新至最新版本即可体验上述功能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">李飞飞团队发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，揭示大模型空间交互短板</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/78e095b7b0fa4ca1f2f5e8f5c0cbb581.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">李飞飞团队近日发布具身智能基准 ESI-Bench，旨在推动 AI 从“被动感知”向“主动行动”进化。该基准构建于 OmniGibson 仿真平台，涵盖 10 个类别、29 个子类别及 3081 个任务实例，核心在于强制模型执行“感知-行动回路”。评测发现，GPT-5 和 Gemini 等顶尖模型在主动探索时表现出显著的“动作盲视”，当模型需自主寻找视角时，准确率从最优视角下的 95.1% 骤降至 14.6%。研究指出，当前模型存在三大核心缺陷：缺乏导航与操纵策略、易受不完美 3D 重建数据的误导，以及缺乏评估信息充分性的“元认知”能力。ESI-Bench 的推出标志着具身智能评测范式从静态图文匹配转向真实物理交互，为未来提升 AI 的序列决策能力与鲁棒性提供了关键评估路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动联合港科大发布MMProLong模型，优化长文档LMM训练效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/322294f33be68d3d0c10e184cd8905a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动Seed团队联合香港科技大学发布多模态大语言模型MMProLong，通过优化训练数据结构提升长文档处理能力。研究发现，针对长文档进行问答对（QA）训练的效果显著优于传统的OCR转录，后者在长上下文中反而会导致性能下降。MMProLong基于Qwen2.5-VL构建，利用Seed2.0生成的长上下文问答对进行训练，在仅128,000个Token的训练预算下，实现了256,000至512,000个Token的上下文稳定性。在MMLongBench和MM-NIAH基准测试中，该模型表现大幅超越InternVL3-38B和Gemma3-27B。此外，该训练策略已在Qwen3-VL-8B上验证有效，并成功迁移至长视频理解任务。此项研究证明，通过优化数据组织形式而非改动底层架构，即可实现长上下文能力的跨越式提升，为</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f5eade8585a31c487191397abb5a32ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中国大模型调用量连续 4 周碾压美国：全球 AI 开发者正加速“国产化”AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 25, 202611根据 OpenRouter 刚刚发布的最新监测数据，全球大模型调用市场正在经历一场“向东看”的剧烈范式转移。上周（5 月 18 日至 5 月 24 日），全球 AI 大模型总调用量攀升至 28.9 万亿 Token，环比增长 7.4%，展现出连续五周不间断的强劲增长势头。在这场算力与应用的全球博弈中，中国大模型不仅在规模上实现了对美国的持续领跑，其增长速度更展现出惊人的爆发力。全球总盘： 全球周调用量高达 28.9 万亿 Token，连续 5 周上涨，AI 基础设施进入高频常态化调用阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
